                    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
                    "body": "Ok so maybe there is a misunderstanding with how it should work by default. I swear in the past whenever you closed MiniFiles the bookmarks would be lost. But now it seems to persist them until you restart Neovim. I am on latest nightly.\n\nSo I guess question 1 is whether that is expected or not? No sense me explaining more details of my use case if this is not expected.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Ok so maybe there is a misunderstanding with how it should work by default. I swear in the past whenever you closed MiniFiles the bookmarks would be lost. But now it seems to persist them until you restart Neovim. I am on latest nightly.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">So I guess question 1 is whether that is expected or not? No sense me explaining more details of my use case if this is not expected.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Ok so maybe there is a misunderstanding with how it should work by default. I swear in the past whenever you closed MiniFiles the bookmarks would be lost. But now it seems to persist them until you restart Neovim. I am on latest nightly.\nSo I guess question 1 is whether that is expected or not? No sense me explaining more details of my use case if this is not expected.",
