                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "That `true` makes it [use the latest state of explorer](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c665f30bb372c2ec8cfd61f7531098d3658b6634/doc/mini-files.txt#L731-L732), which contains bookmarks. If you use `false`, bookmarks are not created (unless they are [created automatically](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c665f30bb372c2ec8cfd61f7531098d3658b6634/doc/mini-files.txt#L527-L535)).",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">That <code class=\"notranslate\">true</code> makes it <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c665f30bb372c2ec8cfd61f7531098d3658b6634/doc/mini-files.txt#L731-L732\">use the latest state of explorer</a>, which contains bookmarks. If you use <code class=\"notranslate\">false</code>, bookmarks are not created (unless they are <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c665f30bb372c2ec8cfd61f7531098d3658b6634/doc/mini-files.txt#L527-L535\">created automatically</a>).</p>",
                    "bodyText": "That true makes it use the latest state of explorer, which contains bookmarks. If you use false, bookmarks are not created (unless they are created automatically).",
                    "createdAt": "2025-05-11T08:15:45Z",
